#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#: src/content/docs/donate.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Support Ditana development through Liberapay, Buy Me a Coffee, GitHub Sponsors, or Patreon."
msgstr "Soutenez le développement de Ditana par l’intermédiaire de Liberapay, Buy Me a Coffee, GitHub Sponsors ou Patreon."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: src/content/docs/donate.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Donate"
msgstr "Faire un don"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/content/docs/donate.md
msgid ""
"Ditana is the result of years of work, built on the conviction that a Linux "
"distribution should explain its choices rather than hide them. It is "
"completely free and open source, and its continued development relies on "
"community support."
msgstr ""
"Ditana est le fruit d’années de travail, fondé sur la conviction qu’une "
"distribution Linux devrait expliquer ses choix plutôt que de les cacher. "
"Elle est entièrement libre et à code source ouvert, et la poursuite de son "
"développement repose sur le soutien de la communauté."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/content/docs/donate.md
msgid ""
"By donating, you enable me to keep enhancing Ditana — exploring new "
"features, responding to user feedback, and maintaining the level of detail "
"this project aims for. Every contribution makes a difference."
msgstr ""
"En faisant un don, vous me permettez de continuer à améliorer Ditana – en "
"explorant de nouvelles fonctionnalités, en répondant aux retours des "
"utilisateurs et en maintenant le niveau de détail que vise ce projet. Chaque "
"contribution compte."

#. type: Title ##
#: src/content/docs/donate.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Where donations go"
msgstr "Où vont les dons"

#. type: Plain text
#: src/content/docs/donate.md
msgid ""
"Donations are processed through **acrion innovations GmbH**, a Swiss company "
"I founded to manage the financial side of my projects. While the company "
"provides the legal and financial framework, **acrion** represents my work as "
"a solo developer. Your support directly funds Ditana's ongoing development, "
"server infrastructure, and the time required to keep up with Arch's rolling "
"release."
msgstr ""
"Les dons sont traités par **acrion innovations GmbH**, une société suisse "
"que j’ai fondée pour gérer l’aspect financier de mes projets. Si la société "
"fournit le cadre juridique et financier, **acrion** représente mon travail "
"de seul développeur. Votre soutien finance directement la poursuite du "
"développement de Ditana, l’infrastructure des serveurs et le temps "
"nécessaire pour suivre la publication continue d’Arch."

#. type: Title ##
#: src/content/docs/donate.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "How to support Ditana"
msgstr "Comment soutenir Ditana"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: src/content/docs/donate.md
msgid ""
"[**Liberapay**](https://liberapay.com/acrion/donate) — recurring donations, "
"no platform fee."
msgstr ""
"[**Liberapay**](https://liberapay.com/acrion/donate) – dons récurrents, sans "
"frais de plateforme."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: src/content/docs/donate.md
msgid ""
"[**Buy Me a Coffee**](https://buymeacoffee.com/acrion) — one-off support."
msgstr ""
"[**Buy Me a Coffee**](https://buymeacoffee.com/acrion) – soutien ponctuel."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: src/content/docs/donate.md
msgid ""
"[**GitHub Sponsors**](https://github.com/sponsors/acrion) — if you already "
"donate to other open-source work via GitHub."
msgstr ""
"[**GitHub Sponsors**](https://github.com/sponsors/acrion) – si vous faites "
"déjà des dons à d’autres travaux à code source ouvert par l’intermédiaire de "
"GitHub."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: src/content/docs/donate.md
msgid "[**Patreon**](https://patreon.com/acriondev) — tiered support."
msgstr "[**Patreon**](https://patreon.com/acriondev) – soutien par paliers."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/content/docs/donate.md
msgid "Thank you for helping keep Ditana alive, growing, and uncompromising."
msgstr ""
"Merci d’aider Ditana à rester vivante, à grandir et à ne faire aucun "
"compromis."

#. type: Plain text
#: src/content/docs/donate.md
msgid "— Stefan"
msgstr "– Stefan"
